<figure id="scene-install" data-scene-panel="install" class="explain-scene"><img class="explain-logo" src="/img/LogoIcon.svg" alt="" width="96" height="96"><h3>Kaasi, on your home screen.</h3><p>Install from your browser on your phone or computer. Open it like an app, and keep tracking offline.</p><div class="device-options"><span><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i> Phone</span><span><i class="fas fa-laptop" aria-hidden="true"></i> Computer</span></div></figure><figure id="scene-debts" data-scene-panel="debts">{{ screen('/assets/screens/debts-home-desktop-part.png','Kaasi debts, receivables and installment overview with illustrative data',845,452,'Debts and receivables') }}<figcaption>Illustrative data.</figcaption></figure><figure id="scene-connected" data-scene-panel="connected" class="explain-scene"><svg class="connection-art" viewBox="0 0 320 160" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="10" y="30" width="70" height="120" rx="10"/><path d="M35 135h20m65-55h80m-12-10 12 10-12 10m-56 20h-12l12-10m-12 10 12 10"/><rect x="230" y="10" width="80" height="110" rx="4"/><path d="M215 135h110"/></svg><h3>Your money goes with you.</h3><p>Track offline on your device. Choose automatic cloud sync to keep your records up to date across signed-in devices when you’re online.</p><p>No account needed for offline use.</p></figure>  </div></div>
</div></section>
